The '''Nite Owl helmet''' was a style of [[Mandalorian]] [[Mandalorian armor|helmet]] worn by [[Mandalorian warrior]]s, known as [[Nite Owls]],<ref name="Sabine My Rebel Sketchbook" /> including [[Bo-Katan Kryze]], the sister of [[Duchess]] [[Satine Kryze]]. The helmet could include several features, such as a targeting [[rangefinder]], [[macrobinocular viewplate]], and [[comlink]].<ref name="Ultimate SW">''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''</ref>

However, other Mandalorians unaffiliated with the Nite Owls also wore such helmets, including members of [[the Tribe]].<ref name="Chapter 8" /> [[Sabine Wren's modified Nite Owl helmet|One]] was worn by [[Ursa Wren]]'s [[Spectres|rebel]] daughter, [[Sabine Wren]].<ref name="Sabine My Rebel Sketchbook" /> [[The Tribe]] also possessed a number of these helmets.<ref name="Chapter 8" /> [[Krownest (individual)|Krownest]] wore one as well.<ref name="Datapad">[[Star Wars: Datapad|''Star Wars'': Datapad]]</ref>

